{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208330","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208330","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120833001:1":{"text":"……ふぅ！やっぱり、洞窟内にはポイズンアラクネがたくさんいますね。解毒剤がなかったら、無事に来れたか分かりません。","source_cn":"……呼！洞里的毒液诡蛛果然多，要是没有中和剂，不知道要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE0CE3DDBD18163A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120833002:1":{"text":"……ク、クモにやられたようだ。解毒剤を持ってる者は？","source_cn":"……我、我好像被咬伤了，你们谁有中和剂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8694818FE3AA7B4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120833003:1":{"text":"コウボウ様、どうしてもついて来なきゃいけなかったんですか？これが最後の解毒剤ですよ。","source_cn":"荒矛老爷，您看看，干嘛非要亲自跟来呢？这是最后的中和剂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB488313277AD2F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120833004:1":{"text":"えぇっ、もう最後なんですか！？だってあの時……","source_cn":"咦，已经用完了吗？！我们之前明明——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84DB882CFF6E27C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120833005:1":{"text":"……えぇ、そりゃあ最後ですよ！だって、コウボウ様が用意させた解毒剤はほんのちょっとだったんですからね！","source_cn":"——用完了，当然用完了！毕竟之前老爷只让我们找了那么一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B3CE6F6A9EBD9A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","documen